Become neutral the same way you became chaotic -- find a neutral altar and
fail to convert it.  Killing a black unicorn, and sacrificing it on a 
neutral altar will always convert a chaotic character to neutral.  I think
killing a black unicorn, and sacrificing anything soon after on a neutral 
altar should work too.
